WEBVTT

00:00.510 --> 00:03.280
The game in which 
you'll all be participating.

00:03.890 --> 00:04.980
It is called...

00:05.510 --> 00:07.480
The Downsizing Game!

00:07.820 --> 00:11.410
Of the nine players present,
 whoever is downsized will be the loser.

00:11.410 --> 00:15.190
The remaining eight will be winners.

