21:07.910 --> 21:12.270
Takayoshi Miura

21:07.910 --> 21:12.270
I, Miura, will cast 
all my votes for 
Fukunaga until
 the 10th vote.

21:11.580 --> 21:15.900
We both bought the voting setup 
from each other for 100,000 yen.

21:11.950 --> 21:16.980
I, Miura, will cast all my votes 
for Fukunaga until the 10th vote.

Amount ¥100,000

21:11.950 --> 21:22.920
I, Miura, will cast all my votes 
for Fukunaga until the 10th vote.

21:11.950 --> 21:16.980
I, Fukunaga, will cast all my votes 
for Miura until the 10th vote.

Amount ¥100,000

21:11.950 --> 21:22.920
I, Fukunaga, will cast all my votes 
for Miura until the 10th vote.

21:16.280 --> 21:19.820
The 100,000-yen payments 
cancel each other out,

21:19.820 --> 21:21.810
but the letter of the deal still stands.

21:22.930 --> 21:27.860
And I can't break it with 
the 100-million penalty.

21:28.770 --> 21:30.630
We're all in the same boat.

21:30.630 --> 21:36.180
The M Ticket contracts mean our votes 
are locked in until the tenth vote.

21:36.180 --> 21:41.180
Which means there's not a 
single thing you can do to—

21:45.520 --> 21:47.430
You bastard!

21:47.430 --> 21:51.030
I said no talking to Nao, 
you stupid piece of shit!

21:51.390 --> 21:52.480
Stop it!

21:52.480 --> 21:54.040
Fukunaga-san, stop it!

21:54.890 --> 22:00.050
Whatever. My plan is all but complete.

22:00.910 --> 22:05.170
It should be clear now 
that you're going down!

22:05.750 --> 22:08.560
It's 100% guaranteed!

